  "accesscheck_method": "An unchanged schema-5 payload duplicated its own token for SecurityImpersonation and supplied FILE_GENERIC_READ/WRITE/EXECUTE and FILE_ALL_ACCESS mappings to AccessCheck. The first descriptor reproduces the observed DACL in memory. Appending an allow ACE on a separate memory copy for only the authentic writer SID and FILE_WRITE_DATA (0x2) changes the 0x100003 result to allowed. This simulation has no kernel-object or device handle.",
